    "text": "Let k be a field of characteristic 0. According to (Yu. I. Merzlyakov, Proc. Stek-\nlov Inst. Math., 167 (1986), 263–266), the family Repk (G) of all canonical matrix\nrepresentations of a k-powered group G over k may be regarded as an affine k-variety.\nFind an explicit form of equations defining this variety.              Yu. I. Merzlyakov",
